1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,660
Meet Zings!

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,620
Your tasks on any device,

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,313
with nothing to download.

4
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:07,393
Just type it the way you'd say it.

5
00:00:07,513 --> 00:00:11,573
Dates, times and priority are picked up for you.

6
00:00:11,917 --> 00:00:14,497
Done? Check it off and move on.

7
00:00:14,617 --> 00:00:18,880
Notes, steps and deadlines stay with every task.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,900
Your plan and your calendar, side by side.

9
00:00:23,367 --> 00:00:27,507
Share a project and plan it together, live.

10
00:00:29,133 --> 00:00:29,973
On your phone,

11
00:00:30,093 --> 00:00:33,333
just open it in the browser and add it to your home screen.

12
00:00:33,453 --> 00:00:35,313
No app store needed.

13
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:37,873
And 25+ more features,

14
00:00:37,993 --> 00:00:41,947
from recurring tasks to reminders and offline mode.

15
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:45,647
Zings. Free and open source.
